 {"q": "2024-12-31", "avail": "2025-02-15", "h": 272, "sh": 99787202, "N": 7947, "br": 3.423, "dbr": -0.225, "dh": 1.49}, {"q": "2025-03-31", "avail": "2025-05-16", "h": 260, "sh": 103281995, "N": 7987, "br": 3.255, "dbr": -0.168, "dh": -4.41}, {"q": "2025-06-30", "avail": "2025-08-15", "h": 277, "sh": 105634899, "N": 8039, "br": 3.446, "dbr": 0.191, "dh": 6.54}, {"q": "2025-09-30", "avail": "2025-11-15", "h": 296, "sh": 110967095, "N": 8024, "br": 3.689, "dbr": 0.243, "dh": 6.86}, {"q": "2025-12-31", "avail": "2026-02-15", "h": 398, "sh": 116623040, "N": 8625, "br": 4.614, "dbr": 0.925, "dh": 34.46}, {"q": "2026-03-31", "avail": "2026-05-16", "h": 430, "sh": 120055985, "N": 8741, "br": 4.919, "dbr": 0.305, "dh": 8.04}, {"q": "2026-06-30", "avail": "2026-08-15", "h": 500, "sh": 131485475, "N": 8857, "br": 5.645, "dbr": 0.726, "dh": 16.28}], "statements": {"n": 19, "from": "2018-10-04", "last": [{"d": "2026-11-12", "n": 1.75, "z": -0.61, "rz": 1.91, "earn": true, "q": "Arrowhead has fundamentally changed over the past 12 months. Where there was once a company that relied solely on great scientific promise, there is now a company that is beginning to translate promise into real patient outcomes and the potential for durable shareholder value growth,", "a": "said Christopher Anzalone, Ph.D., President and CEO at Arrowhead Pharmaceuticals", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/879407/000087940726000077/arwr-202611128kex991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-08-04", "n": 3.45, "z": 0.38, "rz": 0.48, "earn": true, "q": "The recent period for Arrowhead included transformational events that support continued growth,", "a": "said Christopher Anzalone, Ph.D., President and CEO at Arrowhead Pharmaceuticals", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/879407/000087940726000058/arwr-202608048kex991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-05-07", "n": 3.6, "z": 0.49, "rz": 1.4, "earn": true, "q": "Arrowhead continues to show strong execution in meeting and exceeding our commercial, R&D, and corporate goals. The company is on extremely strong footing to continue to drive growth in the near-term with numerous opportunities to create long-term shareholder value,", "a": "said Christopher Anzalone, Ph.D., President and CEO at Arrowhead Pharmaceuticals", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/879407/000087940726000045/arwr-202605078kex991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-02-05", "n": 4.55, "z": 1.25, "rz": -0.28, "earn": true, "q": "We had another quarter of strong execution across all areas of our business and we think Arrowhead is extremely well positioned to build on this progress throughout 2026 and beyond,", "a": "said Christopher Anzalone, Ph.D., President and CEO at Arrowhead", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/879407/000087940726000033/arwr-202602058kex991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-01-06", "n": 0.0, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "The future of obesity care must acknowledge and address the different subtypes of obesity. New therapeutic approaches should focus on reducing visceral fat and combining therapies to achieve a low cardiovascular risk state and improve cardio-renal-metabolic outcomes,", "a": "said Carel le Roux, M.D., Ph.D., Chair in Chemical Pathology and Metabolic Medicine at University College Dublin School of Medicine", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/879407/000087940726000004/exhibit991.htm"}, {"d": "2025-11-25", "n": 0.95, "z": -1.18, "rz": -1.06, "earn": true, "q": "The recent FDA approval of REDEMPLO, indicated as an adjunct to diet to reduce triglycerides in adults with familial chylomicronemia syndrome (FCS), is a transformational milestone for Arrowhead. REDEMPLO is the first and only FDA-approved siRNA medicine for people living with FCS and represents the first FDA-approval …", "a": "said Christopher Anzalone, Ph.D., President and CEO at Arrowhead", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/879407/000087940725000027/arwr-202511258kex991.htm"}], "now": {"d": "2026-11-12", "z": -0.61, "mood": "usual"}, "